    box: fall back to a 2h TTL when the account is on the free trial
    
    Creating a box asked for an 8h auto-stop, which free-trial accounts
    reject with 400 trial_auto_stop_required ("Free-trial Boxes can auto-stop
    after at most 2 hours"), so the Computer panel could never provision a
    box on a trial account. Retry at the trial ceiling when the API says so,
    and surface the API's own message in the thrown error instead of a bare
    status code.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LbrfeNax1KL2rMf7Lwo6gX

